#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:175
msgid ""
"If you install AIBrix with all controllers enabled by default but don't "
"have KubeRay installed, the distributed inference controller will be "
"automatically skipped with a log message."
msgstr ""
"如果按默认启用全部控制器安装 AIBrix，但未安装 KubeRay，分布式推理控制器会自动跳过，"
"并输出一条日志。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:177
msgid ""
"To explicitly disable specific controllers, use the ``--controllers`` "
"flag:"
msgstr "要显式禁用特定控制器，使用 ``--controllers`` 标志："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:187
msgid "Available controllers:"
msgstr "可用控制器："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:189
msgid "``pod-autoscaler-controller``: HPA/KPA-style autoscaling"
msgstr "``pod-autoscaler-controller`` ：HPA/KPA 风格的自动扩缩容"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:190
msgid ""
"``distributed-inference-controller``: Ray-based distributed inference "
"(requires KubeRay)"
msgstr "``distributed-inference-controller`` ：基于 Ray 的分布式推理（需要 KubeRay）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:191
msgid "``model-adapter-controller``: LoRA adapter management"
msgstr "``model-adapter-controller`` ：LoRA adapter 管理"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:192
msgid ""
"``model-route-controller``: Gateway API ``HTTPRoute`` creation for each "
"served model"
msgstr "``model-route-controller`` ：为每个服务中的模型创建 Gateway API ``HTTPRoute``"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:193
msgid ""
"``kv-cache-controller``: Distributed KV cache server orchestration with "
"consistent hashing"
msgstr "``kv-cache-controller`` ：带一致性哈希的分布式 KV cache 服务编排"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:194
msgid ""
"``model-claim-controller``: Multiple models sharing GPUs through "
"ModelClaim (experimental)"
msgstr "``model-claim-controller`` ：通过 ModelClaim 让多个模型共享 GPU（实验性）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:195
msgid ""
"``model-warmup-controller``: Node preparation ahead of use through "
"ModelWarmup (experimental)"
msgstr "``model-warmup-controller`` ：通过 ModelWarmup 提前准备节点（实验性）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:196
msgid ""
"``stormservice-controller``: Multi-node orchestration with P/D and AFD "
"support"
msgstr "``stormservice-controller`` ：支持 P/D 和 AFD 的多节点编排"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:199
msgid ""
"The manager serves an admission webhook only when one of the controllers "
"for its API group is enabled. ``model-adapter-controller``, ``model-"
"claim-controller`` and ``model-warmup-controller`` enable the ``model`` "
"group; ``stormservice-controller``, ``kv-cache-controller`` and "
"``distributed-inference-controller`` enable the ``orchestration`` group; "
"``pod-autoscaler-controller`` enables the ``autoscaling`` group. "
"``model-route-controller`` enables both the ``model`` and "
"``orchestration`` groups, because it watches ModelAdapter and "
"RayClusterFleet. The Deployment webhook is served regardless of "
"``--controllers``. The manager skips the other webhooks at startup and "
"logs each one."
msgstr ""
"只有当某个 API 组的控制器之一被启用时，管理器才会提供该组的准入 webhook。 "
"``model-adapter-controller`` 、 ``model-claim-controller`` 和 "
"``model-warmup-controller`` 启用 ``model`` 组； ``stormservice-controller`` 、 "
"``kv-cache-controller`` 和 ``distributed-inference-controller`` 启用 "
"``orchestration`` 组； ``pod-autoscaler-controller`` 启用 ``autoscaling`` 组。 "
"``model-route-controller`` 会监听 ModelAdapter 和 RayClusterFleet，因此同时启用 "
"``model`` 组和 ``orchestration`` 组。无论 ``--controllers`` 如何设置，都会提供 "
"Deployment webhook。管理器会在启动时跳过其余 webhook，并为每个被跳过的 webhook "
"输出一条日志。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/installation.rst:201
msgid ""
"If the installed webhook configuration still lists a skipped webhook, its"
" ``failurePolicy`` decides what the API server does. Webhooks with "
"``failurePolicy: Ignore`` admit objects without their validation and "
"defaulting. The ModelWarmup webhook uses ``failurePolicy: Fail``, so the "
"API server rejects creating or updating a ModelWarmup while none of the "
"controllers that enable the ``model`` group is enabled."
msgstr ""
"如果已安装的 webhook 配置中仍列出被跳过的 webhook，API 服务器的处理方式由其 "
"``failurePolicy`` 决定。使用 ``failurePolicy: Ignore`` 的 webhook 会放行对象，"
"不进行其校验和默认值设置。ModelWarmup webhook 使用 ``failurePolicy: Fail`` ，"
"因此在启用 ``model`` 组的控制器都未启用时，API 服务器会拒绝创建或更新 ModelWarmup。"

